# Noom

- Shopper-only demo marketplace; checkout does not charge.
- Use `features/*` for vertical slices; validate with `lib/validations/*`.
- All UI strings via next-intl; locales `en` and `ar`.
- Auth.js JWT sessions; guest cart cookie `noom_guest_id`.
- Theme: `@kareem-ghorab/theme` imports in `app/globals.css`.
- Read `AGENTS.md` before large changes.
